cmu-planted-flag-broken = {CAPITALIZE(THE($sentry))} topples, its banner shredded and its mast buckled!
cmu-planted-flag-broken-cant-turn-on = {CAPITALIZE(THE($flag))} is wrecked and won't stay up. It needs repairing first.
cmu-planted-flag-broken-cant-upgrade = {CAPITALIZE(THE($flag))} is wrecked. Repair it before upgrading it.
cmu-planted-flag-broken-examine = [color=red]It's wrecked.[/color] To repair it while it's planted:

cmu-planted-flag-repair-step-cut = Cut away the shredded banner and tangled halyard with wirecutters.
cmu-planted-flag-repair-step-weld-frame = Weld the buckled mast straight with a welder.
cmu-planted-flag-repair-step-rewire = Re-rig the halyard and beacon wiring with { $amount } lengths of cable coil.
cmu-planted-flag-repair-step-screw = Screw the base clamps back down with a screwdriver.
cmu-planted-flag-repair-step-tune = Retune its dropship beacon with an access tuner.
cmu-planted-flag-repair-step-weld-casing = Weld the base housing shut with a welder.

cmu-planted-flag-repair-deploy-first = {CAPITALIZE(THE($sentry))} has to be planted before you can repair it.
cmu-planted-flag-repair-wrong-tool = That's not what {THE($sentry)} needs right now. Next: { $step }
cmu-planted-flag-repair-need-cable = You need at least { $amount } lengths of cable coil.

cmu-planted-flag-repair-start-cut = You start cutting the shredded banner off {THE($sentry)}.
cmu-planted-flag-repair-start-weld-frame = You start welding {THE($sentry)}'s buckled mast.
cmu-planted-flag-repair-start-rewire = You start re-rigging {THE($sentry)}'s halyard.
cmu-planted-flag-repair-start-screw = You start screwing {THE($sentry)}'s base clamps down.
cmu-planted-flag-repair-start-tune = You start retuning {THE($sentry)}'s dropship beacon.
cmu-planted-flag-repair-start-weld-casing = You start welding {THE($sentry)}'s base housing shut.

cmu-planted-flag-repair-done-cut = You cut the last of the shredded banner away from {THE($sentry)}.
cmu-planted-flag-repair-done-weld-frame = {CAPITALIZE(THE($sentry))}'s mast stands straight again.
cmu-planted-flag-repair-done-rewire = You finish re-rigging {THE($sentry)} and hoist a fresh banner.
cmu-planted-flag-repair-done-screw = {CAPITALIZE(THE($sentry))}'s base is clamped down tight.
cmu-planted-flag-repair-done-tune = {CAPITALIZE(THE($sentry))}'s beacon chirps back to life.
cmu-planted-flag-repair-finished = You seal {THE($sentry)}'s base housing. It's ready to fly again.
cmu-planted-flag-repair-finished-others = { $user } finishes repairing {THE($sentry)}.
